WEBVTT

00:00:00.683 --> 00:00:01.360
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 1

00:00:02.417 --> 00:00:03.698
<v><b>Speaker 1:</b></v> Are you feeling better?

00:00:04.143 --> 00:00:06.834
<v><b>Speaker 2:</b></v> Yes, I think I’ll go back to work tomorrow.

00:00:12.529 --> 00:00:13.129
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 2

00:00:14.300 --> 00:00:17.138
<v><b>Speaker 1:</b></v> The shirt you bought me is too small.

00:00:17.412 --> 00:00:18.265
<v><b>Speaker 2:</b></v> Don’t worry.

00:00:18.460 --> 00:00:20.774
I’ll take it back to the shop and change it.

00:00:21.034 --> 00:00:22.401
I still have the receipt.

00:00:27.917 --> 00:00:28.625
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 3

00:00:29.757 --> 00:00:30.841
<v><b>Speaker 1:</b></v> Hi, Jack.

00:00:31.095 --> 00:00:32.761
It’s me, Karen.

00:00:33.369 --> 00:00:40.111
<v><b>Speaker 2:</b></v> I can’t talk now, I’m in a Zoom meeting – I’ll call you back in 15 minutes.

00:00:45.575 --> 00:00:46.267
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 4

00:00:47.234 --> 00:00:49.169
<v><b>Speaker 1:</b></v> That’s my pen you’re using!

00:00:49.481 --> 00:00:50.822
<v><b>Speaker 2:</b></v> Is it? Sorry.

00:00:51.176 --> 00:00:52.519
I’ll give it back in a minute.

00:00:58.446 --> 00:00:59.286
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 5

00:01:00.233 --> 00:01:04.993
<v><b>Speaker 1:</b></v> Can you lend me £20? I’ll pay you back next week.

00:01:05.314 --> 00:01:07.301
<v><b>Speaker 2:</b></v> OK – I’ll ping it to you.

00:01:12.677 --> 00:01:13.504
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 6

00:01:14.453 --> 00:01:16.452
<v><b>Speaker 1:</b></v> Where did you buy those shoes?

00:01:16.806 --> 00:01:19.531
<v><b>Speaker 2:</b></v> I ordered them from Zara, but they’re too big.

00:01:20.065 --> 00:01:21.378
I think I’ll send them back.